From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jim Martin <jimmartin@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 13:46:37 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm/dp: report a failed link retrain before the stream
 starts

msm_dp_ctrl_prepare_stream_on() retrains the link when asked to, or when
channel equalisation no longer holds, but ignores the result silently.
msm_dp_ctrl_channel_eq_ok() also evaluates its link status buffer when
the read fails, so the uninitialised buffer decides whether to retrain.

Log a failed retrain, and treat a failed link status read in
msm_dp_ctrl_channel_eq_ok() as "not equalised". The stream is still
started after a failed retrain, as before, so the enable path of every
msm DisplayPort and eDP output is unchanged.

Assisted-by: Opus 5.5
Signed-off-by: Jim Martin <jimmartin@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dp/dp_ctrl.c | 13 +++++++++----
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dp/dp_ctrl.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dp/dp_ctrl.c
index bffbd90ea69..92e395ac686 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dp/dp_ctrl.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dp/dp_ctrl.c
@@ -2352,7 +2352,8 @@ static bool msm_dp_ctrl_channel_eq_ok(struct msm_dp_ctrl_private *ctrl)
 	u8 link_status[DP_LINK_STATUS_SIZE];
 	int num_lanes = ctrl->link->link_params.num_lanes;
 
-	drm_dp_dpcd_read_link_status(ctrl->aux, link_status);
+	if (drm_dp_dpcd_read_link_status(ctrl->aux, link_status))
+		return false;
 
 	return drm_dp_channel_eq_ok(link_status, num_lanes);
 }
@@ -2587,13 +2588,17 @@ int msm_dp_ctrl_prepare_stream_on(struct msm_dp_ctrl *msm_dp_ctrl,
 		}
 	}
 
-	if (force_link_train || !msm_dp_ctrl_channel_eq_ok(ctrl))
-		msm_dp_ctrl_link_retrain(ctrl, panel);
+	if (force_link_train || !msm_dp_ctrl_channel_eq_ok(ctrl)) {
+		ret = msm_dp_ctrl_link_retrain(ctrl, panel);
+		/* Report it, but start the stream as the driver always has. */
+		if (ret)
+			DRM_ERROR("link retrain failed: %d\n", ret);
+	}
 
 	/* stop txing train pattern to end link training */
 	msm_dp_ctrl_clear_training_pattern(ctrl, panel, DP_PHY_DPRX);
 
-	return ret;
+	return 0;
 }
 
 int msm_dp_ctrl_on_stream(struct msm_dp_ctrl *msm_dp_ctrl, struct msm_dp_panel *panel)
-- 
2.56.0

